      "title": "Career",
      "description": "Career | HKUST(GZ) More about HKUST University News Academic Departments A-Z Life@HKUST Library Map & Directions Careers at HKUST Faculty Profiles About HKUST Contact Us HKUST(GZ) CAREER HKUST(GZ) CAREER We are delighted that you are considering joining our esteemed team of educators and researchers. At HKUST(GZ), we are committed to attracting top-tier talent to drive our academic and research excellence. As a faculty member, you will have the opportunity to engage in cutting-edge research, collaborate with leading scholars, and shape the minds of the next generation of innovators. We invite you to explore the exciting opportunities and resources available at HKUST(GZ) and join us in our mission to make a meaningful impact in the world. Faculty and Staff Openings Culture (Under Development) Benefits and Wellness (Under Development) Campus Life Professional Development (Under Development) Testimonials Learn More on our Academic Structure Cross-Campus Collaboration How to Apply Faculty Position FAQ Search ADMINISTRATIVE SERVICE DEPARTMENTS 0 Job ID Posting Title Division/Unit 5900 Technical Officer（NICE 光电工程师） Novel IC Exploration Facility (NICE) 6018 Vice-President for Student Affairs (VPSA) 香港科技大学（广州） 6069 Administrative Officer (Recruitment and Admissions) Office of Student Affairs (OSA) 6077 Technical Officer（NICE 测试工程师） Novel IC Exploration Facility (NICE) 6234 洗消间工作人员（清洁洗消方向） Laboratory Animal Facility (GZ) (LAF (GZ)) 6232 实验动物饲养技术员(兽医检测平台/胚胎移植和净化平台) Laboratory Animal Facility (GZ) (LAF (GZ)) 6512 Vice-President for Academic Affairs (VPAA) 香港科技大学（广州） 6511 Vice-President for Knowledge Transfer (VPKT) 香港科技大学（广州） 6553 科长/副科长 (心理咨询师 University Counselor) Office of Student Affairs (OSA) 6554 Administrative Officer (食品安全监督员) Office Of Lab Facilities and Safety   (OLFS) 6570 Frontend Developer 前端工程师 Development & Teaching Support(DTS) 6572 Officer (111 AIoT) Vice-President (Research) (VPR) 6575 Administrative Officer (SHMC) Office of Student Affa